  "description": "Control-plane (management/introspection) client for a running vLLM server: model cards (served aliases, the actually loaded model via the root field, max context length, LoRA adapters), health probe, server version, and Prometheus metrics.\n\nFamily taxonomy: Mythosia.AI.Providers.* = chat data plane (concrete AI services); Mythosia.AI.Serving.* = model-server control plane. Chat/completions against vLLM stay on Mythosia.AI (e.g. QwenService with EndpointPlatform.Vllm) — this package does not chat and does not host a server.\n\nDocumentation\n- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI\n- Release Notes: src/serving/Mythosia.AI.Serving.Vllm/RELEASE_NOTES.md",
