  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0-preview: Initial preview — VllmServer control-plane client: GetModelsAsync/GetModelAsync (model cards incl. the stable-but-undocumented root/parent/max_model_len fields, DisplayModel fallback, LoRA detection), GetVersionAsync, IsHealthyAsync/GetHealthAsync (Healthy/EngineDead/Unauthorized/Unreachable/Unexpected), GetMetricsAsync (label-preserving Prometheus families + typed convenience getters), VllmException with OpenAI-style error-body parsing. Depends only on Newtonsoft.Json.",
